NOTE ON SCOPE:

This MIT license applies to the tool itself — the code that renders and runs
the interactive map and its companion pages (all .html, .css and .js files
in this repository, and the general structure/logic of data.js and
specialization-data.js). Third-party code in vendor/ keeps its own license.

It does NOT extend to the world-specific content contained in this repository,
including but not limited to: province geometry, names, and boundaries;
climate, terrain, and economic-output data and their categorization; the
specialization pools and import tables in specialization-data.js; the
underlying world map (SVG/raster source files); and any lore, place names, or
setting material derived from them. That content is proprietary and all
rights are reserved — see NOTICE for details.
